notes: CinC 2018 is primarily an *arousal* challenge. Full AASM sleep-stage and
respiratory-event XML is often absent; unmatched epochs get stage_id=0 and
apnea=0 unless a sidecar annotation file is provided (.xml / .csv / .json).
Signals are typically 200 Hz in WFDB .mat+.hea; the exporter resamples to 256 Hz.
